flowchart TD
  I[intent] -->|matched plan| OK[validated]
  I -->|no plan match| INP[gap: intent-not-planned]
  I -->|plan match no claim| INI[gap: intent-not-implemented]
  CLM[assistant claim] -->|tool + repo evidence| OK
  CLM -->|no evidence| CNV[gap: claim-not-validated]
  CLM -->|evidence contradicts| CCT[gap: claim-contradicted]
  PL[plan item] -->|superseded by later instruction| SUP[gap: superseded-plan-item]
  PL -->|never referenced again| STL[gap: plan-stale]
  PL -->|absent for known intent| OMI[gap: plan-omission]
  TS[session-only decision] --> SOD[gap: session-only-decision]
  ART[expected artifact missing] --> MA[gap: missing-artifact]
  VAL[validation absent] --> MV[gap: missing-validation]
  AMB[ambiguous evidence] --> AE[gap: ambiguous-evidence]
